      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        350.13720703125,
        527.6181030273438,
        364.5802307128906
      ],
      "text": "bacteriologically confirmed pulmonary TB, proven or presumed multidrug-resistant TB or extensively",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991847038269043,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        363.33721923828125,
        527.4500122070312,
        377.7802429199219
      ],
      "text": "drug-resistant TB, is a person living with HIV or is a child younger than 5 years. Among contacts of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        376.5372009277344,
        527.4332885742188,
        390.980224609375
      ],
      "text": "patients with bacteriologically confirmed TB, the weighted pooled prevalence of TB was 3.4% (95%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        389.7372131347656,
        527.4432983398438,
        404.18023681640625
      ],
      "text": "CI: 2.9–3.8). Among contacts of patients with multidrug-resistant or extensively drug-resistant TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        402.93719482421875,
        527.4232788085938,
        417.3802185058594
      ],
      "text": "the weighted pooled prevalence of TB was 3.7% (95% CI: 2.4–5.3). The weighted pooled prevalence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        416.13720703125,
        527.4200439453125,
        430.5802307128906
      ],
      "text": "of TB among HIV-positive contacts was 11.6% (95% CI: 8.2–15.4), with a median NNS of 9 (95% CI:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.33721923828125,
        527.4166870117188,
        443.7802429199219
      ],
      "text": "5–13). The weighted pooled prevalence among contacts younger than 5 years was 3.9% (95% CI:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        442.5372009277344,
        527.3781127929688,
        456.980224609375
      ],
      "text": "2.5–5.4), with a median NNS of 30 (95% CI: 12–62), while the prevalence among contacts aged 5–14",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        455.7372131347656,
        527.411376953125,
        470.18023681640625
      ],
      "text": "years was 2.4% (95% CI: 1.6–3.4), with a median NNS of 36 (95% CI: 17–61). Contact investigation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        468.93719482421875,
        390.3592834472656,
        483.3802185058594
      ],
      "text": "may also be performed for TB patients with all other forms of disease.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        490.64111328125,
        527.4531860351562,
        505.0841369628906
      ],
      "text": "The definition of a household or close contact can vary greatly across settings, and in some contexts",
