      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        503.8411865234375,
        527.223876953125,
        518.2841796875
      ],
      "text": "there is no clear distinction between households; therefore, decisions about screening household and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981233596801758,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.0411376953125,
        527.4443969726562,
        531.484130859375
      ],
      "text": "close contacts should be based on local definitions and policies, prioritizing contacts for screening",
