      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        603.6896362304688,
        527.4248046875,
        620.9266357421875
      ],
      "text": "(23) the risk of rapid disease progression in children younger than 5 years , as well as the importance",
