    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        641.3875732421875,
        527.2313842773438,
        655.83056640625
      ],
      "text": "Contacts who are persons living with HIV are also of particular importance in contact screening, given",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98133373260498,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        654.5875854492188,
        527.44091796875,
        669.0305786132812
      ],
      "text": "their extremely high prevalence of TB disease. Contacts living with HIV are also at increased risk for",
