      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        667.78759765625,
        527.3814697265625,
        682.2305908203125
      ],
      "text": "rapid progression to TB disease, and if they develop it, an increased risk of mortality. Contacts of TB",
