        70.86609649658203,
        680.9876098632812,
        527.4387817382812,
        695.4306030273438
      ],
      "text": "patients who are also living with HIV are at a higher probability of themselves being HIV-positive,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        694.1876220703125,
        527.40478515625,
        708.630615234375
      ],
      "text": "even they are unaware of their status. Thus, in settings with a high prevalence of HIV or when the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        707.3875732421875,
        527.4464721679688,
        721.83056640625
      ],
      "text": "index case is a person living with HIV, or both, all household contacts and close contacts should be",
